<h1>Scrabble Game Types</h1>

<hr />

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-sm-6">
        <img src="~/img/standardboard.PNG" width="100%" />
    </div>

    <div class="col-sm-6">
        <div class="card">
            <h5 class="card-header">Standard Scrabble Board</h5>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p>This is as close the the real game as possible. It is 15x15 squares with all the bonus spaces the same as usual.</p>
                <p>
                    To understand how to play and the scoring etc. we suggest reading the rules from the Official source(s) - either Mattel or Hasbro:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <a target="_blank" href="https://scrabble.hasbro.com/en-us/rules">Hasbro - How to Play & Rules</a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a target="_blank" href="https://service.mattel.com/instruction_sheets/53639-ENG.pdf">Mattel - How to Play & Rules</a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    The tile distribution in the bag is also the same as the standard game:
                </p>
