            <h5 class="card-header">Mini Scrabble Board</h5>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p>Harder than it looks; this is a great one for a quick game or to hone your skills playing on a tight board. It is 9x9 and the bonus spaces have been adjusted to fit.</p>
                <p>
                    This is played with the same Scrabble rules as the standard board with the exception of the available tiles and the bonus spaces.
                </p>
