            <h5 class="card-header">SuperSize Scrabble Board</h5>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p>Think big, think bold. This board really allows you to spread out and get the higher point words. It is 19x19 and the bonus spaces have been adjusted to fit.</p>
                <p>
                    Our tip with this board is to use it for a longer game or to spice up a game with three or four players.
                    This is played with the same Scrabble rules as the standard board with the exception of the available tiles and the bonus spaces.
